    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Privacy Policy - WhatsApp Assistant</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:760px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;line-height:1.7;color:#222}h1{color:#1f3a5f}h2{margin-top:28px;color:#1f3a5f}</style></head><body><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: October 12, 2026</p><p>This Privacy Policy explains how our WhatsApp customer service assistant (\"the Service\") collects, uses, and protects your information when you message us on WhatsApp.</p><h2>1. Information We Collect</h2><ul><li>Your WhatsApp phone number and profile name.</li><li>The content of the messages you send to us.</li><li>Message metadata such as message type and time.</li></ul><h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2><ul><li>To read your message and reply to your questions or orders.</li><li>To improve the quality of our customer service.</li><li>To escalate your request to a human team member when needed.</li></ul><h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2><p>To provide the Service we use trusted providers: Meta (WhatsApp Business Platform) to send and receive messages, OpenAI to generate replies, Supabase to store conversation records, and n8n to automate the workflow. These providers process data only to deliver the Service.</p><h2>4. Data Sharing</h2><p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with the service providers listed above or when required by law.</p><h2>5. Data Retention</h2><p>We keep conversation records only as long as needed to provide the Service, then delete them or remove identifying details.</p><h2>6. Your Rights and Data Deletion</h2><p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data at any time by emailing us at the address below. We will respond within 30 days.</p><h2>7. Security</h2><p>We use reasonable technical measures to protect your data, but no method of transmission or storage is completely secure.</p><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>For any privacy questions or deletion requests: <a href=\"mailto:mostafaelmniawy7@gmail.com\">mostafaelmniawy7@gmail.com</a></p><hr><h1 dir=\"rtl\">سياسة الخصوصية</h1><p dir=\"rtl\">نجمع رقم هاتفك واسمك على واتساب ومحتوى رسائلك للرد على استفساراتك فقط، ولا نبيع بياناتك لأي جهة. يمكنك طلب حذف بياناتك في أي وقت عن طريق التواصل معنا على البريد المذكور أعلاه.</p></body></html>",
